<mjml><mj-head><mj-title>GatorBait Magazine: Friday Pregame, Florida at Missouri</mj-title><mj-preview>Franz Beard leads the Friday pregame edition. Florida at Missouri, Saturday at 3:30 p.m. ET on ABC.</mj-preview><mj-attributes><mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" /><mj-text color="#11274A" font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" /><mj-button background-color="#FA4616" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="3px" font-size="16px" font-weight="800" /></mj-attributes></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#EEF1F5">
