<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="22px 24px 8px"><mj-column><mj-text color="#4B586A" font-size="17px" padding="0 0 8px">No. 8 Florida is 2-4 in Columbia since 2012 and has to find an emotional peak right after the biggest win in years. Franz Beard asks if the Gators are tough enough.</mj-text><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine" padding="14px 0 6px">OPEN THE FULL MAGAZINE</mj-button><mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-soothsayer-gators-head-to-missouri-where-history-hasn-t-been-kind" background-color="#081F3D" padding="6px 0 12px">READ FRANZ&#8217;S COLUMN</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section>
